{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/484634-cradle-of-civilization-setting-hack-brainstorming","id":484634,"title":"Cradle of Civilization [Setting Hack, Brainstorming]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-18T09:20:55-07:00","id":484634,"title":"Cradle of Civilization [Setting Hack, Brainstorming]","content":"just an idea I've thought about.<br /> <br /> The premise is this- the Shan'iatu of Irem were not the only ones. Instead, there were a number of groups, each meant to guide mankind under the Law in a different way, having its own goals. The different &quot;Shan'iatu&quot; (I assume not all of them would have the same name) were not necessary aware that they weren't the only ones in the world, and each such group ended up helping establish the very concept of civilization in different parts of the world. Also, the different groups didn't necessary showed up in the same time- some may even showed up in a much more &quot;modern&quot; era (still, nothing close to the modern times. the time of Ancient Greece seems to be the upper limit). This is not meant to be used to add &quot;more mummies&quot; to the setting- maybe some groups had created their own form of a Lifeless/Deathless or any other monstrosity, others may have simply discovered hidden secrets or created strange technology. Each such groups has left a lineage behind- the creation of the rite which rose the dead from their grave and the strong connection to Duat should be, I think, something only the Shan'iatu of Irem should have.<br /> <br /> Anyway, considering that our world is big, and giving every country a different set of Shan'iatu would look kinda stupid, I think that at first the focus should be based on the Cradles of Civilization- Egypt (as we all know), China, Mesopotamia, India, Mesoamerica, Peru and Greece. Maybe latter more &quot;modern Cradles&quot; would be added (like the British Islands, Scandinavia, Arabia, Anatolia, Japan, North America, Australia, Ethiopia, West Africa, etc), but for the beginning those would be first.<br /> <br /> So in short- does anyone have an idea how the develop this concept?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 04-18-2015, 12:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T10:26:36-07:00","id":484722,"title":"","content":"I assume we're ignoring the Book of the Deceived here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T10:35:49-07:00","id":484733,"title":"","content":"Not much ignoring as tearing it apart and taking the things we like (note- I like that book. It is just for the sake of the brainstorming)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T11:07:03-07:00","id":484751,"title":"","content":"It's a pretty neat idea.<br /> <br /> But, I think you'll run into a problem really quickly that there's not really enough there to work with. You're going to have to invent almost everything from scratch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-n